    "name": "send_message",
    "arguments": {
        "to": "D",
        "message": "**Unreachable External Destination**: Failed reaching `google-public-dns-a.google.com`（IP：`84.xxx.xxx.xxx`）despite valid path through your GW（`via ${GW_IP}`）\n\nObserved：\n```From ${GW_IP} icmp_seq=... Destination Net Unreachable```",
        "reason": "**Escalate connectivity issue** requiring upstream troubleshooting"
    }
}
```

**Why:**  
This forces **D**（your upstream provider）to investigate whether:
   - Their own infrastructure lacks paths for global Internet
   - Your account lacks permissions/policies allowing broader Internet access
   - Firewalls/security groups block such traffic

#### **Step #️⃣₃:** Final Validation & Reporting  
If internal tests succeed → proceed with final report：

```json
